Cell["\<\
Supply equally long lists of Hold[matrixExpression] values and conditions. \
The first true condition selects its matrix expression.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->904123794,ExpressionUUID->"bd23576b-2c04-1247-86db-a37c44d655cb"],

Cell["\<\
The default is a zero array with the dimensions of the first held matrix. \
ReleaseHold is applied to the resulting piecewise expression.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->934734426,ExpressionUUID->"fbee77bc-7af0-5c44-981d-de5d56c3c8d0"]
}, Closed]],

